                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Harvest Simulator VR, a game where you get what you expect at this price,\nand even at this price you will easily be sweet for quite a few hours of harvest pleasure.\n\nCheck out my first harvests here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SYMphhr_ZxM\n\nAs the title already describes, you will be responsible for planting and harvesting vegetables.\nYou can resell these vegetables after harvesting to be able to buy new and different seeds that will bring in more money when you sell them.\nYou also start with 0 dollars and 0 seeds and your first income with which you will eventually buy seeds comes from selling eggs from your chickens that have an area for themselves on your domain,\nyou have to sell the eggs and that's how you earn your first cents.\n\nyou have 6 or 8 fields at your disposal where you can plant your seeds, you will be able to fill them all fairly quickly,\nbut the more fields you fill, the more water you will have to give to your growing vegetables,\nyou pour this water with a watering can, and you get the water from your well,\nfrom a moment your activity consists of non-stop planting, watering, harvesting and selling, and before you know it you can buy all kinds of vegetables and have a nice sum of money.\nBut what do you do with all that money?\nTo entertain yourself, you can purchase furniture that you can then place in your house that is also on your domain, and so you can decorate the environment in the house as you wish.\nAll in all this game for this price and good deal.",
